<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Admiral narrows six month loss.</title>
<headline>Admiral narrows six month loss.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended Feb 28 compared to 12 months ended Feb 29</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Shr, (cts)</p>
<p>    - headline loss	 2.11	  vs  4.92</p>
<p>    - attrib loss	   2.52	  vs  4.92</p>
<p>    Attrib loss	     0.88	  vs  1.72</p>
<p>    Pre-tax loss	    0.87	  vs  0.16</p>
<p>    Tax			 0.19	  vs  0.22</p>
<p>    Turnover		  8.74	  vs  10.4</p>
<p>    Exceptional loss	0.10	  vs  nil</p>
<p>    Associates' loss	0.19	  vs  0.22</p>
<p>Full name: Admiral Leisure World Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said no dividend had been declared for the period under review.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
